  "id": "RAW_81f2d131ee",
  "title": "DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 架构，Context 的重整化",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MjU4MDYwOA==&mid=2247492704&idx=1&sn=fbf6e8a9b9d536b0f67e34ba03356e4e",
  "date": "2026-09-10 20:01:00",
  "author": "清熙",
  "siteName": "清熙",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>王庆法</span> <span>2026-09-10 20:01</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260910161851_4b84eca.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>到今天 V4.1-Flash，DeepSeek 终于实现了笔者期待的原生多模态，DeepSeek 将开启多模态“信息动力学”新范式。</p>\n  <div style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;\">\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;margin-top: 0 !important;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">发布，开始把Context从</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">Token序列</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">转化为</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">计算状态</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;margin-top: 0 !important;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">传统 Transformer 面对长度为&nbsp;</span></span><span data-math-display=\"false\" data-math-raw=\"$L$\" style=\"max-width: 100%;overflow-x: auto;cursor: pointer;\"> \n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 -683 681 683\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px;display: initial;max-width: 300vw !important;flex-shrink: 0;width: 1.541ex;\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n      <g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" style=\"fill: currentColor;stroke: currentColor;\">\n       <g data-mml-node=\"math\">\n        <g data-mml-node=\"mi\">\n         <path data-c=\"1D43F\" d=\"M228 637Q194 637 192 641Q191 643 191 649Q191 673 202 682Q204 683 217 683Q271 680 344 680Q485 680 506 683H518Q524 677 524 674T522 656Q517 641 513 637H475Q406 636 394 628Q387 624 380 600T313 336Q297 271 279 198T252 88L243 52Q243 48 252 48T311 46H328Q360 46 379 47T428 54T478 72T522 106T564 161Q580 191 594 228T611 270Q616 273 628 273H641Q647 264 647 262T627 203T583 83T557 9Q555 4 553 3T537 0T494 -1Q483 -1 418 -1T294 0H116Q32 0 32 10Q32 17 34 24Q39 43 44 45Q48 46 59 46H65Q92 46 125 49Q139 52 144 61Q147 65 216 339T285 628Q285 635 228 637Z\"></path>\n        </g>\n       </g>\n      </g>\n     </svg> \n    </span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;的Context，全注意力计算量为&nbsp;</span></span><span data-math-display=\"false\" data-math-raw=\"$O(L^2)$\" style=\"max-width: 100%;overflow-x: auto;cursor: pointer;\"> \n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"2.452ex\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 2658.6 1083.9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;display: initial;max-width: 300vw !important;flex-shrink: 0;width: 6.015ex;\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n      <g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" style=\"fill: currentColor;stroke: currentColor;\">\n       <g data-mml-node=\"math\">\n        <g data-mml-node=\"mi\">\n         <path data-c=\"1D442\" d=\"M740 435Q740 320 676 213T511 42T304 -22Q207 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435ZM637 476Q637 565 591 615T476 665Q396 665 322 605Q242 542 200 428T157 216Q157 126 200 73T314 19Q404 19 485 98T608 313Q637 408 637 476Z\"></path>\n        </g>\n        <g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(763,0)\">\n         <path data-c=\"28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n        </g>\n        <g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1152,0)\">\n         <g data-mml-node=\"mi\">\n          <path data-c=\"1D43F\" d=\"M228 637Q194 637 192 641Q191 643 191 649Q191 673 202 682Q204 683 217 683Q271 680 344 680Q485 680 506 683H518Q524 677 524 674T522 656Q517 641 513 637H475Q406 636 394 628Q387 624 380 600T313 336Q297 271 279 198T252 88L243 52Q243 48 252 48T311 46H328Q360 46 379 47T428 54T478 72T522 106T564 161Q580 191 594 228T611 270Q616 273 628 273H641Q647 264 647 262T627 203T583 83T557 9Q555 4 553 3T537 0T494 -1Q483 -1 418 -1T294 0H116Q32 0 32 10Q32 17 34 24Q39 43 44 45Q48 46 59 46H65Q92 46 125 49Q139 52 144 61Q147 65 216 339T285 628Q285 635 228 637Z\"></path>\n         </g>\n         <g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(714,363) scale(0.707)\">\n          <path data-c=\"32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n         </g>\n        </g>\n        <g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2269.6,0)\">\n         <path data-c=\"29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n        </g>\n       </g>\n      </g>\n     </svg> \n    </span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">，KV Cache则随&nbsp;</span></span><span data-math-display=\"false\" data-math-raw=\"$L$\" style=\"max-width: 100%;overflow-x: auto;cursor: pointer;\"> \n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 -683 681 683\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px;display: initial;max-width: 300vw !important;flex-shrink: 0;width: 1.541ex;\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n      <g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" style=\"fill: currentColor;stroke: currentColor;\">\n       <g data-mml-node=\"math\">\n        <g data-mml-node=\"mi\">\n         <path data-c=\"1D43F\" d=\"M228 637Q194 637 192 641Q191 643 191 649Q191 673 202 682Q204 683 217 683Q271 680 344 680Q485 680 506 683H518Q524 677 524 674T522 656Q517 641 513 637H475Q406 636 394 628Q387 624 380 600T313 336Q297 271 279 198T252 88L243 52Q243 48 252 48T311 46H328Q360 46 379 47T428 54T478 72T522 106T564 161Q580 191 594 228T611 270Q616 273 628 273H641Q647 264 647 262T627 203T583 83T557 9Q555 4 553 3T537 0T494 -1Q483 -1 418 -1T294 0H116Q32 0 32 10Q32 17 34 24Q39 43 44 45Q48 46 59 46H65Q92 46 125 49Q139 52 144 61Q147 65 216 339T285 628Q285 635 228 637Z\"></path>\n        </g>\n       </g>\n      </g>\n     </svg> \n    </span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;增长。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5188755020080321\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1245\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100009047\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260910161851_38b07b3.png\"></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;margin-top: 0 !important;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">经笔者</span><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(172, 57, 255);\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MjU4MDYwOA==&amp;mid=2247490178&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=bb9f1fb06d96a70d9b4dbd3e707368b5&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"大模型数理原理\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(172, 57, 255);text-decoration: underline;\">大模型数理原理</span></a><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">分析，V4.1-Flash 的核心思路，是沿深度、空间、时间和数值精度不断压缩 Context 的有效自由度。</span></span></p>\n   <h4 data-heading=\"true\" style=\"margin: 2em 8px 0.5em;color: #0F4C81;font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CED：沿</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">深度</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">重整化Context</span></span></h4>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">V4.1-Flash 引入 Causal Encoder-Decoder（CED），将网络分成前后两个阶段。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Causal Encoder 先对 Context 做因果编码，形成中间状态；Decoder 基于这一状态生成 Token，使超长 Context 不必以原始序列形式贯穿整个网络。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">更重要的，CED 引入了输入与输出的</span></span><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81;font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">非对称计算</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: normal;\">，</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Prefill 每个 Token 激活约 8B 参数，Decode 激活约 16B 参数。读取长 Context 时采用较低计算预算完成粗粒化，生成 Token 时投入更多计算资源。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">用 RG 语言，CED 可以理解为沿网络深度对 Context 做粗粒化，从高维 Token 序列提取后续推理所需要的</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">有效表征</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">。</span></span></p>\n   <h4 data-heading=\"true\" style=\"margin: 2em 8px 0.5em;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Engram：静态记忆与动态状态</span></span></h4>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">V4.1 扩大了 Engram 静态记忆，约 196B 参数。高频、确定性的 N-gram 模式可以直接通过 Lookup 获取，减少它们反复进入主干网络进行动态计算的需要。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">这样，模型形成两条记忆路径，</span></span><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81;font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Engram 保存相对稳定的静态关系，CED 与 KV Cache 保存当前 Context 的动态状态。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">这相当于把一部分已经稳定的关系固定下来，把仍需根据上下文演化的关系留在动态状态空间中。</span></span></p>\n   <h4 data-heading=\"true\" style=\"margin: 2em 8px 0.5em;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CSA2：沿深度复用关系</span></span></h4>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CED 完成 Context 的粗粒化，CSA2 进一步减少网络深度方向上的重复计算。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Attention 可以拆成两个问题，Indexer 决定</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">去哪里找</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">，KV 决定</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">那里有什么</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CSA2 根据不同层的变化程度，在 Full、Reuse 和 Reindex 之间切换，使变化较小的层复用已有关系，只对发生变化的部分重新计算。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.45806451612903226\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1240\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100009051\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260910161851_eb4c125.png\"></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">RG 视角，网络深度上的表征逐渐形成相对稳定的富集范畴；后续层无需重新构造全部态射，只需更新发生变化的局部关系，TTT时同理。</span></span></p>\n   <h4 data-heading=\"true\" style=\"margin: 2em 8px 0.5em;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Indexer：沿空间筛选态射</span></span></h4>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">超长 Context 的另一个瓶颈，是 Query 面对的关系空间过大。V4.1 通过层次化 Indexer，先进行候选关系的粗筛，再选择 Top-K，将平坦搜索转化为分层检索。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">它没有消除 Context 长度带来的搜索依赖，只是把完整关系图逐步粗粒化，只保留当前 Query 所需要的</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">有效态射</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">所以，稀疏 Attention 的核心可以理解为，</span></span><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81;font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">减少关系自由度，不简单减少Token。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <h4 data-heading=\"true\" style=\"margin: 2em 8px 0.5em;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Replay：沿时间管理状态</span></span></h4>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Context 还有时间维度。历史状态没有必要始终保持最高分辨率，Bounded Replay 只保留有限范围的局部状态，需要恢复时再进行重放。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">这与</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">Memory 保存关系，Recall 采样过去</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">高度一致。过去不必完整驻留在当前计算空间，只需要作为可恢复状态存在。</span></span></p>\n   <h4 data-heading=\"true\" style=\"margin: 2em 8px 0.5em;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">FP4：压缩状态的物理表征</span></span></h4>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">经过 Context 粗粒化、静态记忆剥离、跨层复用和关系筛选后，仍需保存的 KV 状态，再通过低位宽表征进一步压缩。算力不足不得已。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">这样会形成一条连续的信息压缩链，</span></span><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81;font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">减少状态数量，减少重复计算，缩短状态生命周期，再降低单个状态的存储精度。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CED、Engram、CSA2、Indexer、Replay 和 FP4 不是彼此孤立的优化，它们共同控制 Context 状态的生成、表征、检索、复用、生命周期和存储。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3803169307756464\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1199\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100009053\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260910161851_132e2d2.png\"></p>\n   <h4 data-heading=\"true\" style=\"margin: 2em 8px 0.5em;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">V4.1：从Token到状态，从状态到范畴</span></span></h4>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CED 沿深度完成 Context 粗粒化，Engram 固化稳定关系，CSA2 沿深度复用关系结构，Indexer 沿空间筛选有效态射，Replay 沿时间管理状态，FP4 最后压缩其物理表征；</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">加上曾详细解读的mHC，</span><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(172, 57, 255);\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MjU4MDYwOA==&amp;mid=2247490951&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=df63be8e00d2cc86b35a6df3b5366b17&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"DeepSeek mHC：一次将 Transformer 残差流拉回重整化轨道的重大升级\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(172, 57, 255);text-decoration: underline;\">DeepSeek mHC：一次将 Transformer 残差流拉回重整化轨道的重大升级</span></a></span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">，形成了一条“</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: normal;\">Token-表征-关系-状态-采样”</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">的重整化流。</span></span></p>\n   <div style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;\" data-pm-slice=\"3 4 []\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81;font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: normal;\">V4.1-Flash 的重要变化，是这种“表征-关系-采样”的结构开始直接进入推理计算。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Context 不单是模型需要处理的一串 Token，还逐渐成为可以被重整化、复用、检索、重放和压缩的关系状态。</span></span></strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">学习过程是重整化，学习结果是富集范畴，推理是采样逆重整化</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">。</span></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">到今天 V4.1-Flash，DeepSeek 终于实现了笔者一直期待的</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">原生多模态</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">，</span><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(172, 57, 255);\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MjU4MDYwOA==&amp;mid=2247491040&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5defaad2f997d0f1d6b89e0527afa8e2&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"DeepSeek OCR + mHC 将开启多模态“信息动力学”新范式\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(172, 57, 255);text-decoration: underline;\">DeepSeek 将开启多模态“信息动力学”新范式</span></a><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81;font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: normal;\">笔者感觉，后</span></span><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: #0F4C81;font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: normal;\">V4.1-</span></span></strong><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: #0F4C81;font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 76, 129);font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: normal;\">F</span></span></strong><strong style=\"color: #0F4C81;font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;text-align: left;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: #0F4C81;font-weight: bold;font-size: inherit;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: normal;\">lash的基础大模型架构，应该开始考虑</span><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(172, 57, 255);\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MjU4MDYwOA==&amp;mid=2247492622&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e04bb2e060302decfe245b58087a40df&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"内生的时空能力\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(172, 57, 255);font-weight: normal;text-decoration: underline;\">内生的时空认知能力</span></a><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: normal;\">了。</span></span></strong></strong></p>\n   <p style=\"margin: 1.5em 8px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;color: #3f3f3f;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash/blob/main/DeepSeek_V41_Tech_Report.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash/blob/main/DeepSeek_V41_Tech_Report.pdf</a></span></span></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 实现了原生多模态，通过 Causal Encoder-Decoder、Engram 静态记忆、CSA2 跨层复用、Indexer 关系筛选、Bounded Replay 和 FP4 压缩，将 Context 从 Token 序列转化为可重整化的计算状态，开启了信息动力学新范式。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 实现了原生多模态，通过 Causal Encoder-Decoder、Engram 静态记忆、CSA2 跨层复用、Indexer 关系筛选、Bounded Replay 和 FP4 压缩，将 Context 从 Token 序列转化为可重整化的计算状态，开启了信息动力学新范式。",
  "summary": "V4.1-Flash 沿深度、空间、时间和数值精度不断压缩 Context 的有效自由度。CED 粗粒化输入，Engram 固化稳定关系，CSA2 复用不变关系，Indexer 筛选有效态射，Replay 管理历史状态，FP4 压缩物理表征。这些模块共同控制 Context 状态的生成、表征、检索、复用、生命周期和存储，使模型能够高效处理超长上下文。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "CED 沿深度重整化 Context",
      "explanation": "Causal Encoder-Decoder 将网络分为前后两阶段，先对 Context 进行粗粒化编码，再基于此生成 Token，实现输入与输出的非对称计算，降低超长上下文的计算负担。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Engram 静态记忆与动态状态",
      "explanation": "Engram 存储高频、确定性的 N-gram 模式，形成稳定的静态关系，而 CED 与 KV Cache 则保存当前 Context 的动态状态，实现记忆的层次化管理。"
    },
    {
      "point": "CSA2 沿深度复用关系",
      "explanation": "CSA2 根据层间变化程度，在 Full、Reuse 和 Reindex 之间切换，复用不变的关系结构，减少重复计算，提高推理效率。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Indexer 沿空间筛选态射",
      "explanation": "层次化 Indexer 对关系空间进行粗筛，只保留当前 Query 所需的有效态射，将平坦搜索转化为分层检索，减少计算复杂度。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Replay 沿时间管理状态",
      "explanation": "Bounded Replay 只保留有限范围的局部历史状态，需要时再进行重放，避免历史状态对当前计算的永久占用。"
    },
    {
      "point": "FP4 压缩状态的物理表征",
      "explanation": "经过粗粒化和筛选后的 KV 状态，通过低位宽表征（FP4）进一步压缩，减少存储需求，形成连续的信息压缩链。"
    }
  ],
